    "body": "- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\nHi!\r\nI use this plugin everyday and I love it. Thank you for maintaining it.\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite is `mini.jump`, and I would like to add one option for that.\r\n\r\nThis is called `only_in_cursor_line`. It is similar to `g:clever_f_across_no_line` in clever-f (https://github.com/rhysd/clever-f.vim/blob/master/doc/clever_f.txt).\r\n\r\nIf it looks good for you, please consider to merge it.\r\nThanks",
